  "boundaries": [
    "Firefox/WebKit are Playwright synthetic evidence, not real device or branded Safari/iOS proof.",
    "Axe does not prove WCAG conformance.",
    "Lighthouse is lab diagnosis, not field Core Web Vitals.",
    "The bounded link scan intentionally excludes query URLs and caps discovery/probes; probe methods remain GET/HEAD only.",
